abstract: >-
  Python scripts and processed data for reproducing the figures and supporting
  analyses of a study on Atlantic ITCZ variability, rainbelt broadening, SST,
  and zonal moisture organization. Associated manuscript: Atlantic ITCZ
  Broadening, Zonal Aggregation, and Warm SSTs.
  Code is licensed under MIT; processed data in data/ are licensed under
  CC BY 4.0, with the original Copernicus attribution and terms retained.
